+    /**
+     * The list of things a sideways drag along the bar can do.
+     *
+     * <p>Its value is kept in Bare's own preference rather than persisted by the list itself, so
+     * what is stored is the number naming the action and not the word shown to the user. The words
+     * are translated and the stored value must not be.
